nd we recommend using the presets feature instead to save your gradients.</p><div style="gap:var(--lum-label-gap)" class="flex flex-col" :="20_3"><label for="decode" class="text-lum-text flex items-center gap-1 select-none" :><svg q:slot="before-label" width="16" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-Sparkle" :="U6_1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path : d="M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z"></path></svg>Decode</label><textarea placeholder="&amp;#54DAF4B&amp;#54C8EBi&amp;#54B7E2r&amp;#54A5D9d&amp;#5493D1f&amp;#5481C8l&amp;#5470BFo&amp;#545EB6p" q:p="394" : id="decode" class="lum-input font-mc h-16 w-full whitespace-pre-wrap" q-e:input="q-Dq1bJrmE.js#_run#395"></textarea><span : class="text-lum-text-secondary text-sm">Copy-paste an existing RGB text here to edit it</span></div><div style="gap:var(--lum-label-gap)" class="flex flex-col" :="20_3"><label for="threshold" class="text-lum-text flex items-center gap-1 select-none" :><svg q:slot="before-label" width="16" height="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-Settings" :="U6_1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path : d="M9.671 4.136a2.34 2.34 0 0 1 4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1 2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0 3.831 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33 4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.319 1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-4.659 0 2.34 2.34 0 0 0-3.32-1.915 2.34 2.34 0 0 1-2.33-4.033 2.34 2.34 0 0 0 0-3.831A2.34 2.34 0 0 1 6.35 6.051a2.34 2.34 0 0 0 3.319-1.915"></path><circle : cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle></svg>Threshold</label><div class="text-lum-text flex touch-manipulation gap-1" :=