l" id="import" name="import" q-e:input="q-Dq1bJrmE.js#_run#414"></div><div : class="flex flex-wrap gap-1"><button q-e:click="q-Dq1bJrmE.js#_run#415" q:ps="416" : class="lum-btn flex-1 rounded-r-sm" id="copy"><svg width="20" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-Copy" :="U6_1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect : width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path : d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg>Copy</button><button q-e:click="q-Dq1bJrmE.js#_run#418" q:ps="419" : class="lum-btn flex-1 rounded-l-sm" id="createurl"><svg width="20" height="20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-Link" :="U6_1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path : d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path><path : d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path></svg>Get Url</button></div></div></div></div><div : class="text-lum-text-secondary mt-8 flex flex-col gap-2 text-sm sm:flex-row"><p : class="sm:border-lum-border/10 sm:border-r">RGBirdflop (RGB Birdflop) is a free and open-source Minecraft RGB gradient creator that generates hex formatted text. RGB Birdflop is a public resource developed by Birdflop, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit providing affordable and accessible hosting and public resources. If you would like to support our mission, please <a : href="https://www.paypal.com/US/fundraiser/charity/5036975">click here</a> to make a charitable donation, 100% tax-deductible in the US.</p><p :>Want to automate generating gradients or use this in your own project? We have <a : class="text-lum-accent hover:underline" href="/docs/rgbirdflop/npm_package">an NPM package</a> and <a : class="text-lum-accent hover:underline" href="/docs/rgbirdflop/api">an API</a>!</p></div></div></section><div : class="fixed flex max-w-full flex-col gap-1 md:max-w-2/2 lg:max-w-2/3 xl:max-w-2/4 right-4 bottom-4" id="notifications" style="--lum-border-radius:1rem"></div><footer :="zq_1" class="bg-lum-card-bg border-t-lum-border/10 text-lum-text-secondary relative mt-20 flex w-full items-center justify-center gap-10 border-t p-6 pb-20 text-sm"><p :>Birdflop is a registered 501(c)(3) <a : href="https://birdflop.org" class="text-lum-accent hover:underline">nonprofit organization</a> (EIN: 93-2401009). Learn more at <a : href="https://birdflop.org" class="text-lum-accent hover:underline">birdflop.org</a> and <a : href="https://csroom.org" class="text-lum-accent hover:underline">csroom.org</a>.<br :>By using this site, you agree to our <a : href="/terms" class="text-lum-accent hover:underline">Terms of Service</a> and <a : href="/privacy" class="text-lum-accent hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.<br :>Items marked with an asterisk (*) are a reminder that our Terms of Service apply.</p><div : class="flex flex-col items-end"><div : class="mb-2 flex gap-1"><a : href="https://github.com/birdflop/web" title="GitHub" class="lum-btn lum-bg-transparent hover:lum-bg-nav-bg fill-current p-2"><svg width="20" height="20" class="simple simple-SiGithub" :="HX_1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><title :>GitHub</title><path : d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.